[al:新概念英语（二）]
[ar:MP3 同步字幕版（美音）]
[ti:Taken for a Ride]
[by:更多学习内容，请到VeryCD.com搜索“露珠”]
[00:09.59]Why did the writer not get off the bus at Woodford Green? | 为什么作者没在伍德福德草地站下车？
[00:16.09]I love travelling in the country, | 我喜欢在乡间旅行，
[00:18.92]but I don't like losing my way. | 但却不愿意迷路。
[00:22.63]I went on an excursion recently, | 最近我进行了一次远足，
[00:25.41]but my trip took me longer than I expected. | 但旅行时间比我预想的要长。
[00:30.20]'I'm going to Woodford Green,' | “我要去伍德福德草地，”
[00:32.63]I said to the conductor as I got on the bus, | 我上车时对售票员说，
[00:36.84]'but I don't know where it is.' | “可我不知道那地方在哪儿。”
[00:40.50]'I'll tell you where to get off.' answered the conductor. | “我会告诉您在哪儿下车的。”售票员回答说。
[00:46.00]I sat in the front of the bus to get a good view of the countryside. | 我坐在汽车的前部，以便饱览乡村风光。
[00:52.18]After some time, the bus stopped. | 过了一会儿，汽车停了。
[00:55.92]Looking round, I realized with a shock that I was the only passenger left on the bus. | 我环视了一下四周，吃惊地发现车上只剩我一个人了。
[01:04.21]'You'll have to get off here,' | “您得在这里下车了，”
[01:07.03]the conductor said. 'This is as far as we go.' | 售票员说，“我们的车就到此为止了。”
[01:12.42]'Is this Woodford Green?' I asked. | “这里是伍德福德草地吗？”我问。
[01:16.04]'Oh dear,' said the conductor suddenly. | “哦，天哪，”售票员突然说。
[01:20.23]'I forgot to put you off.' | “我忘了让您下车了。”
[01:23.32]'It doesn't matter,' I said. 'I'll get off here.' | “没关系，”我说，“我就在这儿下车吧。”
[01:28.45]'We're going back now,' said the conductor. | “我们现在要返回去，”售票员说。
[01:32.68]'Well, in that case, | “哦，既然如此，
[01:34.90]I prefer to stay on the bus,' I answered. | 我还是留在车上吧。”我回答说。
